  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GRANT-SUPPORT 1000 DAYS SCT PILOT ON NUTRITION UNDER UNJPSP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the 1000 Days in SCT Pilot is to explore if nutritional status among pregnant and lactating women in SCT households can be improved with the provision of additional cash to the monthly transfer.  UNICEF is implementing this pilot under its support to the Ministry of Community Development and Social Services social protection programme.</narrative>
  </description>
